January's Puzzle!              NannyMUD Times                         Page 6

An adventurer was searching an old tomb for treasure, when he triggers a
trap. He falls trough a trap door beneath him in a dim lighted room.
In the room he finds a table with 9 buttons and a note:

  If you want to get out of here alive, you have to push the 9 buttons in a
  certain order. The first button is given to you:
  
      _|_|_
      _|_|1
      _|_|_

If you enter the wrong combination, you are doomed.
The rule is that the if you count the numbers horizontally, vertically or
diagonally you get 15 everytime.

Can you help the adventurer escape?

